# ── Repository source boundary (PB-DIST-HYGIENE-2) ──────────────────────────────
# Platform/plugin source code and tests are ALWAYS tracked. Only build output and
# local artifacts are ignored (see the artifact rules elsewhere in this file). Do
# NOT reintroduce bare-filename ignores of source classes, nor broad "tests/*" or
# "tests/Feature/*" hides — both silently drop platform source from version control.


# Theme sync notes
THEME_SYNC_AUDIT.md
THEME_SYNC_REPORT.md

# Local archives
themes/*.zip
themes/*.rar

# Local published assets
public/themes/

# Generated Page Builder bundles (reproducible via `npm run build`)
/public/vendor/page-builder/

# Local uploads
public/uploads/

# tokensave runtime DB state (RTK/tokensave MCP local index — never distributed)
.tokensave/tokensave.db
.tokensave/tokensave.db-shm
.tokensave/tokensave.db-wal
